    {
      "id": "2fcd44aa-ebe0-4487-82da-8d3a25ff92b9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ComfyUI Error Reset\n\nCatches **ComfyUI Runner failures** and cleans up orphaned state.\n\n### Triggered by\n\nThe ComfyUI Runner's error output \u2014 when a generation fails (ComfyUI down, prompt reject, timeout, etc.).\n\n### What it does\n\n1. **Read the running job** \u2014 reads the `running_job` store to find the ComfyUI Jobs row ID that was being processed when the error occurred\n2. **Clear the job's Working flag** \u2014 sets `Working=false` on the failed ComfyUI Jobs row so it becomes pickable again for retry\n3. **Clear the store** \u2014 resets the `running_job` store\n\n### Why it matters\n\nWithout this, a failed runner run leaves `Working=true` on the job row. The row becomes invisible to the normal queue picker (which filters `Working=false`). The job is stuck until manually reset.\n\nThis workflow makes failures self-healing \u2014 the row gets cleared and re-enters the queue automatically.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6d88454-cf38-4a6d-b8fa-4b33d455dd72",
      "name": "Validate Failure Scope",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const tables={\"M9SnVr1xBYNDwJDF\": \"vN5vMR56WpEsdLMn\", \"MZK3Pv01FHqZbooz\": \"xKckTZI3ZU5HqIpZ\", \"TWMnQqnEwD7qTfbp\": \"vN5vMR56WpEsdLMn\", \"x4AirppgK2nvJGuf\": \"vN5vMR56WpEsdLMn\"};const workflowId=String($json.workflow?.id||'');const executionId=String($json.execution?.id||'');if(!tables[workflowId]||!/^\\d+$/.test(executionId))return [];return [{json:{workflowId,executionId,tableId:tables[workflowId]}}];"
      }
    },
    {
